    "content": {
      "snl": "thm-hyp(list-partial(LA.VectorSpace(V@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace, $\\mathbb{K}$@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace), Type.annotation(@v, V@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace)), Logic.iff(LA.LinearlyIndependent(LA.Singleton(v), V@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace), Neq(v, LA.Zero(V@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace))))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "zh-CN",
        "values": {
          "zh-CN": "单元素向量族 $\\{v\\}$ 线性无关当且仅当 $v\\ne\\mathbf{0}_V$。",
          "en": "The singleton family $\\{v\\}$ is independent iff $v\\ne\\mathbf{0}_V$."
        }
      }
